Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,On that day, the rain didn't let up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that shit out, it's annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that male prison guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd he have to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let this down anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Damn it! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're at it,\Nwhat's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, it's Joe... something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.27,0:01:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, like, well, basically, he, um, well,\Nit's a word that starts with M. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you know, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, ma-ma-ma-s,\Nuh, you know, master...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,oh god, patient, basically. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.49,0:01:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you kidding me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just say a guard\Nsaw you masturbating?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So he caught you flicking the bean, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, which card was it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I woke up at dawn this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was looking at the shape\Nof the bars on the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And the moonlight was\Nshining through just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I started getting horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, uh, well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I looked up from my\Nbed, I saw him standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the youngest guard here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just standing outside\Nof my cell watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The look on his face through\Nthese bars was sickening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.54,0:02:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It made me want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to end it all now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a real handsome guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, how much\Ndid our peeping Tom see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to ask straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were your panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They weren't at your ankles, were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that something you really need to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.02,0:02:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way I'd tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've already decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the day I die, I won't even\Nthink about masturbating again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear on my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, we'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell do you get horny from\Nlooking up iron bars like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're into freaky shit, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, you nosy skank!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business instead of eavesdropping\Nand judging people you don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't like you've never done it before!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think about doing\Npervy stuff like you two hoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Back that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet I'll last longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You clawed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell kinda bet would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Masturbating is a dirty little\Nsecret you keep to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so how are you supposed to\Nprove you didn't do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I said I could tell\Nby your left ring finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,what exactly would you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were brought in here for\Nsomething sex-related, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a prose finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention detainees number 21, 22, and 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In an orderly fashion, stand up and place\Nboth of your arms outside of the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Was all that ring finger crap true?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You a fortune teller?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Part Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one interesting Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being prosecuted for stealing a\Nvehicle, as well as running someone over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Given your history of two previous thefts,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,your bail most definitely\Nwon't be approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Jojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you will now be transferred\Nto Green Dolphin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Prison's custody jail to\Nbe tried for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get ready for a trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Jojo, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Only my mother calls me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're talking about history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But all I did was borrow\Na motorcycle for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does it even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I was 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is\Nthat I'm innocent here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You better defend me with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not cheap, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the law, I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, when is Mama coming to visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably bawling her eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's bummed, to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than anything,\Nshe's worried for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought some things for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be wearing your prison\Nuniform during your trial, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you'll find a change of\Nclothes, as well as some vitamins,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,reading material, and your schoolwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears to be a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you open it, there's\Na small stone inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:05:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, when your\Nfather divorced your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he told her to give this to you if you\Nwere to ever find yourself in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you making a fuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of stone is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,More important, why are you\Nbringing up my deadbeat dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you must know, your mother has no\Nway of getting a hold of your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With his work as a marine biologist,\Nhe's been hard to pin down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We last got word that he's conducting\Nresearch somewhere in Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's taking a while to call him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of trying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like he'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That prick's never here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for that kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So screw him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Down this sinister crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When can I see you next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet in two days for your trial\Nat Green Dolphin Prison's custody jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you were innocent earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be a custody jail,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's still established in\NGreen Dolphin Prison, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're being transferred\Nthere, you might...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After the trial, it'll all be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm going\Nto be sent to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're coming up to the bridge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be arriving\Nin about ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They said we'll be arriving soon. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just hear the driver?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be crossing the bridge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll reach the prison in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know he was going to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Another of your fortune-telling skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was I able to hear him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mystery to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a funny girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the name's Hermes Costello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I got caught robbing a convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my second time, so they're\Nthrowing me in the slammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Dolphin Street State\NPrison and its custody jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Also known as The Aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lot area, 120 square kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Total detainees include 708 men,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,523 women, and 452 juvenile\Ndelinquents under the age of 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, did you bring\Nany cash along with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.49,0:09:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, I'm only trying to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't walk into that\Nplace with at least $100 or $200,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,things ain't gonna work out too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck if your pockets\Nare empty, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to watch your back until\Nyou can get someone to bring you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.65,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not going to\Nprison, so why do you even care?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, best to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not like\Nyou have any money either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you did, they would have\Nfound it during the pat-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're naive, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's lots of ways to\Nsneak money past the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you rolled\Nit up and stuck it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,up your ass or some\Nother part of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it doesn't work\Nlike in the movies, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a rookie move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They check those kind of places\Nright away and where's yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it's in your boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you save some room for cash\Nwhen you got those implants put in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:10:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the cat's out of the bag now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stitch is small, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll bleed a little when I take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got $520s hidden away in one\Nside and two fifties stashed in the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we have arrived at Green\NDolphin Street Prison Custody Jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 21 and 29, get off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 22, Hermes Costello, you\Nwill not be getting off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey mister did you just say something to\Nme did your head face it forward number 21
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's been off since earlier,\Nbut these guards can't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like what\Nhappened before the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear Your voice is from afar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that chatter right now, Number 21!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can they seriously not see this\Nthread-like thing coming out of my hand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Okay, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This just won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is chump change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to split\Nthis with my partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.28,0:12:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You got something locked up tight\Nin your body somewhere, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the bus suddenly breaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't got nobody to bring\Nme something from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why if I lose that money, I'll be\Ngood as dead the moment I walk in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, your breasts are rather\Nbig despite that muscular build.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Those titties are suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We should examine them, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold her down for me, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bitch, who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange! What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Could all this be that thing's fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of madness did you send my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,back when we met at the\Npolice detention cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw away the pendant you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what happened to it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't say I recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.34,0:13:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than that, let's\Ntalk about the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to insist you're\Ninnocent, I want to make things clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When the accident happened,\Nwho was driving the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've been thinking about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo, would it be okay if I started\Ncalling you Rochu, like a pet name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But only if you say it\Nwhen I'm nowhere near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.91,0:14:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of that, silly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cute, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rochu, I'm hungry, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What would I say to my\Nfriends if they heard you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares what they think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't they ever seen flirting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the day I was born, my mama's\Ncalled me Jojo, so it means a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use it too, Rochu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,More important, I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sip, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.78,0:15:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This cocktail is a 10% alcohol\Nlevel. It's fine. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no means no, so no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,ROMEO!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,ROMEO!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,ROMEO!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to call someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo, he needs an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go doing anything crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the phone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry and help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy's glasses are in my windshield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to run, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This was all an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't just run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This car is the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll report that it was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I can't go to jail now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do, our future is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get locked up for this, we won't\Nbe able to see each other anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you lying when you\Ntold me you loved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.88,0:16:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I do love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If they see us, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.37,0:16:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, give me a hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this guy is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just help me, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you. Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The prosecutors believe that you stole a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,car and crashed it while\Nunder the influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he have to say about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who reported the theft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening. Kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you really the one\Ndriving, or was it Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, have you ever heard\Nof plea bargaining before?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, it means the\Nprosecutors will ignore the DUI,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you admit to\Nall the other charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take the deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll only be charged\Nwith theft and accidental
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,homicide with a suspended\Nsentence of about a year or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to defend me with your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is the deal that\Nthey're offering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If at trial they deem you guilty, you'll\Nbe locked up for five years at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're running out of time, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The trial is happening soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so you need to decide if you're\Ntaking the bargain or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Defendant Jolene Cujo,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.54,0:17:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,do you understand all of\Nthe details of the presented
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,plea bargain and approve\Nof it without reservation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this court will take into account\Nthat Defendant Jolene Cujo has pled
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,guilty on all charges and given the fact\Nthe said offense was not premeditated,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.62,0:18:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,we will also be considering room\Nfor the extenuating circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,this court cannot forgive the act of\Ndeliberately killing the victim who was still
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.86,0:18:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,alive by proceeding to throw him into\NSwampland in order to cover up the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean he was still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this old guy saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliberately killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Defendant Jolene Cujo is sentenced to 15\Nyears in Green Dauphin Street State Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,where she will remain under the watchful\Neye of strict guards to pay for her crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Court adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,15 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I bargained like you told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I admitted to the crimes, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Lawyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I defended you the best that I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My work's done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay healthy now, Jolene Cujo. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm facing 15 whole years!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what you said!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit your squirming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.10,0:19:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You said get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You can breathe easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The sentence has been determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the plea bargain, she won't\Nbe able to appeal to a higher court.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And this case will have\Nno further investigations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.64,0:19:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You really saved my ass here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.77,0:19:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can thank your wealthy\Nfather for lining my pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen goddamn years!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years of my youth\Ngone just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up prisoner in\Naddition to the name you got
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,from the parent that gave\Nbirth to your sorry ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be given a welcome number\Nthat the state has appointed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This prison is currently\Nat security level four.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.20,0:20:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,FE40536
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,if you hear this number called at any time,\Neven if you're sitting on the shitter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you will respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Drill that into your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now conduct a full body search.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove all clothing and place everything\Ninto the tray in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.34,0:20:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get to stripping on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you gotta teach the trash\Nthe lesson than from
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:21:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the beginning by\Nhumiliating them real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.16,0:21:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to strip, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That means everything,\Nincluding your panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.22,0:21:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And then stick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to be on all fours or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Would facing upward be better?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather I do a bridge for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You. You...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you walk away so shamelessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, it's warm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My shirt's all sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking like rain might fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to sit in the\NChief's office for a breather?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The AC works well in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,since the documents have been submitted\Nand formalities complete, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I worry though, this heat is nothing\Ncompared to what my client has been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years, and still so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the lack of my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as lawyers go, you're\Na diamond in the rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.16,0:22:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo gave me a letter addressed\Nto you and asked me to pass it along.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The contents have been checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.66,0:22:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass this on to him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling comfy, but you will\Nkeep sweating now and forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,what you might be out of my
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,reach right now but I won't be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,powerless forever there's no\Nway I'm waiting 15 years I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,going to find you as for you Romeo\Ngoodbye for now my first love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The air in there was stifling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.86,0:22:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, AC.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, that is so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathing the same air as\Nthose scums of the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.66,0:22:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,is one of the worst parts\Nof work in this job,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something thread-like is strangling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.98,0:23:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the damn AC\Nthat's drying out my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.82,0:23:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.84,0:23:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can use it like this too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It reacts to my thoughts and feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can control it with\Nthe strength of my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand why he gave me the\Npendant, so I could protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, this is going to be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.84,0:24:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.84,0:24:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
